; AmShell M1.6 command-file differential qualification
FailAt 20
MakeDir T:AmShellM16 >NIL:
CompatNative native-command.txt T:AmShellM16/native-script.out
Echo $RC >T:AmShellM16/native-script.rc
AmShell basic.script >T:AmShellM16/amshell-script.out
Echo $RC >T:AmShellM16/amshell-script.rc
Echo M1.6 guest run complete
